   "name": "The Rite of Aeons",
   "aliases": [
    "the Rite"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "central"
   ],
   "status": "canon",
   "summary": "The ritual that held back Oblivion three hundred years ago, went wrong, and must be performed again.",
   "body": "The five points of the pentacle are the five tombs, each holding a mortal element. Each requires a sacrifice with a strong resonance to that element, who must not have died before. The first Rite removed all Eldritch from the world and broke the Annwyn off from Arnesse.",
   "sources": [
    {
     "label": "Event 9 Synopsis & Definitions"
    },
    {
     "label": "Event 10 — The End Design Doc"
    }
   ]
  },
